    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d255-a1">

                <pb facs="0948" n="917" sameAs="frus:frus1981-88v44p1/pg917"/>


                <head>Talking Points Prepared in the National Security Council<anchor n="5"
                        xml:id="d255-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian">undated</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Talking Points on SDI Restructuring</hi></p>
                <list>
                    <label>—</label>
                    <item>It’s been over a year and a half since the President has had a briefing on
                            SDI plans and progress.</item>
                    <label>—</label>
                    <item>Since that meeting much has happened: the DAB approved a Phase I architecture; we’ve been hit with
                        Congressional funding cuts; and, proposals have come from several quarters
                        for a limited deployment.</item>
                    <label>—</label>
                    <item>We need to make sure the President is comfortable with the course of
                            SDI when he leaves office.</item>
                    <label>—</label>
                    <item>Therefore, I’d like to schedule an NSPG
                        meeting to brief the President on the program, and give you an opportunity
                        to advise him on next steps.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
